--- Tor with webtunnel server ---

Because the webtunnel tor package is outdated, I use this to once a week build a new container image
containing Tor from the alpine package repository and the webtunnel-server from the go package repository.

Container available from ghcr.io/fh3095/docker-tor-webtunnel / https://github.com/FH3095/docker-tor-webtunnel/pkgs/container/docker-tor-webtunnel
